<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Content formats</title></head><body><nav><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/handbook">Handbook</a></nav><h1>Content formats</h1><p class="tagline">A folded scalar that spans several source lines and collapses into one.
</p><pre class="banner">literal line one
literal line two
</pre><dl class="staging"><dt>adapter</dt><dd>postgres</dd><dt>host</dt><dd>localhost</dd><dt>database</dt><dd>formats_staging</dd></dl><ul class="flags"><li>alpha</li><li>beta</li><li>gamma</li></ul><ul class="docs"><li><a href="/docs/intro">Introduction</a><span class="tags">markdown, gfm</span></li><li><a href="/docs/guide">Guide</a><span class="tags">mdx</span></li></ul></body></html>

